  "sentences": [
   {
    "t0": 0.0,
    "t1": 1.74,
    "n": 4,
    "wpm": 137.9,
    "text": "beans have gotten cheaper."
   },
   {
    "t0": 2.06,
    "t1": 4.56,
    "n": 8,
    "wpm": 192.0,
    "text": "At that news, your wallet pumps its fist."
   },
   {
    "t0": 4.88,
    "t1": 8.62,
    "n": 14,
    "wpm": 224.6,
    "text": "In your mind, the price of your usual cup has already come down, too."
   },
   {
    "t0": 9.02,
    "t1": 11.88,
    "n": 12,
    "wpm": 251.7,
    "text": "But the price tag in a shop may not change right away."
   },
   {
    "t0": 12.36,
    "t1": 15.7,
    "n": 17,
    "wpm": 305.4,
    "text": "When you see a price tag that makes you want to say, haven't you heard the news?"
   },
   {
    "t0": 16.08,
    "t1": 17.52,
    "n": 7,
    "wpm": 291.7,
    "text": "It seems there is a time lag."
   },
   {
    "t0": 18.06,
    "t1": 24.16,
    "n": 17,
    "wpm": 167.2,
    "text": "The price measure reported by the International Coffee Organization fell 8 .7 % from the previous month."
   },
   {
    "t0": 24.68,
    "t1": 31.4,
    "n": 23,
    "wpm": 205.4,
    "text": "The reason, it said, was that more beans harvested in Brazil had entered the market, and a good supply was expected to continue."
   },
   {
    "t0": 32.8,
    "t1": 37.86,
    "n": 15,
    "wpm": 177.9,
    "text": "Department of Agriculture said that earlier high prices came from several factors happening at once."
   },
   {
    "t0": 38.32,
    "t1": 43.36,
    "n": 14,
    "wpm": 166.7,
    "text": "Bad weather in Brazil and Vietnam, fewer beans available for sale, and strong demand."
   }
  ]
 },
