  "sentences": [
   {
    "t0": 0.0,
    "t1": 1.32,
    "n": 3,
    "wpm": 136.4,
    "text": "Meanwhile, U .S."
   },
   {
    "t0": 1.66,
    "t1": 7.92,
    "n": 22,
    "wpm": 210.9,
    "text": "consumer price data showed that the price of coffee was 6 .1 % higher than in the same month a year earlier."
   },
   {
    "t0": 8.66,
    "t1": 11.88,
    "n": 11,
    "wpm": 205.0,
    "text": "It may leave you wondering, did prices go down or up?"
   },
   {
    "t0": 12.18,
    "t1": 14.98,
    "n": 12,
    "wpm": 257.1,
    "text": "But the data covers a different month from the bean price measure."
   },
   {
    "t0": 15.34,
    "t1": 17.56,
    "n": 13,
    "wpm": 351.4,
    "text": "And it does not show the price of a cup at a cafe."
   },
   {
    "t0": 18.18,
    "t1": 20.32,
    "n": 10,
    "wpm": 280.4,
    "text": "Hold on before putting the two figures in the ring."
   },
   {
    "t0": 20.76,
    "t1": 24.18,
    "n": 16,
    "wpm": 280.7,
    "text": "So how long does it take for the price of beans to reach a price tag?"
   },
   {
    "t0": 24.74,
    "t1": 32.56,
    "n": 31,
    "wpm": 237.9,
    "text": "According to estimates from market insiders and experts interviewed by Reuters, it It takes at least about 9 months for the price of raw beans to show up in U .S."
   },
   {
    "t0": 32.82,
    "t1": 33.36,
    "n": 2,
    "wpm": 222.2,
    "text": "retail prices."
   },
   {
    "t0": 34.12,
    "t1": 36.4,
    "n": 11,
    "wpm": 289.5,
    "text": "The road to a price tag is quite a long journey."
   },
   {
    "t0": 36.96,
    "t1": 38.94,
    "n": 9,
    "wpm": 272.7,
    "text": "The article says that companies in the U .S."
   },
   {
    "t0": 39.04,
    "t1": 41.16,
    "n": 8,
    "wpm": 226.4,
    "text": "that roast coffee keep raw beans in stock."
   },
   {
    "t0": 41.68,
    "t1": 43.76,
    "n": 8,
    "wpm": 230.8,
    "text": "Roasting and packing the beans also take time."
   },
   {
    "t0": 44.24,
    "t1": 47.56,
    "n": 11,
    "wpm": 198.8,
    "text": "They also often negotiate prices with retailers on a regular basis."
   },
   {
    "t0": 48.16,
    "t1": 51.9,
    "n": 18,
    "wpm": 288.8,
    "text": "The price tag in a shop does not flash to a new price the moment the market moves."
   }
  ]
 },
